<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Schlumberger target raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Schlumberger target raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities said it raised its price target on Schlumberger Ltd to $165 from $140. The time frame for the target was not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- said raised the 1997 earnings estimate to $4.95 a share from $4.80 a share and increased the 1998 estimate to $6.10 a share from $5.90 a share.</p>
<p>-- Schlumberger gained 5-5/8 to 138-3/8.</p>
